        "direction_id",
        "size_label",
        "language",
        "format",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "add_variant",
  },
  {
    "description": "Delete one variant of an open project, with its layers. A master cannot be deleted. This cannot be undone. It also empties the undo list of its whole campaign, so the campaign's earlier changes can no longer be undone either. The user is asked in the app every time, and this call waits up to two minutes for the answer. A refusal is final: do not ask again for the same variant unless the user tells you to.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "properties": {
        "project_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string",
        },
        "variant_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "project_id",
        "variant_id",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "delete_variant",
  },
  {
    "description": "Write the text of one translated text layer (a variant not in the main language) of an open project. The text is saved as proposed, never approved: only the user approves. With apply_to_same_language, also the same layer in the other variants of the direction in that language, unless their copy is overridden. Gives the IDs of the layers written. The user can undo it.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "properties": {
        "apply_to_same_language": {
          "type": "boolean",
        },
