        "variant_id",
        "format",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "set_variant_format",
  },
  {
    "description": "Import picture, video or font files into an open project by their full paths, at most 20 at a time. The user is asked every time and sees each full path; you wait up to two minutes, and a refusal is final. Each file is copied into the project. Gives one asset ID per path, in order. Text files, SVG and folders are not accepted. A run you start makes options for the user to choose from. Leave the choice to the user unless they asked you to choose.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
